sted under data.things[].data, not at the top level.", "[REDDIT_POST_REDDIT_COMMENT] 403 indicates permission/community/thread restriction; rate limiting may appear as HTTP 200 with a failure flag and cooldown message—back off and retry later."], "reference_workbench_snippets": [{"description": "Locate comment children across common thread wrappers (configure keys externally).", "code": "```python
