{"data": {"results": [{"index": 1, "use_case": "Create a new Airtable base for tracking my team's projects.", "execution_guidance": "IMPORTANT: Follow the recommended plan below. Extract steps before execution, adapt to your current context, execute sequentially with current_step parameter, and check known pitfalls to avoid errors.", "recommended_plan_steps": ["[Optional (if write permissions/scopes are uncertain)] [Prerequisite]: Confirm identity and schema-write access using AIRTABLE_GET_USER_INFO (avoid failing mid-creation).", "[Required] [Prerequisite]: Obtain the destination workspace identifier for AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE (must come from user/admin context; not derivable via these tools).", "[Optional (if account/workspace context is uncertain)] [Prerequisite]: Review accessible bases using AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES (sanity-check you’re operating in the intended account).", "[Required] [Step]: Create the base using AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE (use base_name plus a minimal initial table with a valid primary field).", "[Optional (if AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE returns 422 schema validation)] [Fallback]: Retry AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE with an even simpler initial schema, then add structure using AIRTABLE_CREATE_TABLE followed by AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD (create tables before linked fields).", "[Optional (for verification/capturing identifiers)] [Next Step]: Inspect the created base using AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA (confirm structure and capture table/field references).", "[Optional (after schema is ready)] [Next Step]: Expand/seed by adding tables/fields using AIRTABLE_CREATE_TABLE and AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD, then add rows using AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS (batch writes)."], "known_pitfalls": ["[AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE] Requires a workspace identifier supplied out-of-band; AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES, AIRTABLE_GET_USER_INFO, and AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA do not provide it reliably.", "[AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE] 403 errors commonly indicate missing scopes or an invalid workspace identifier; recheck access before retrying.", "[AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE] 422 can occur with complex/invalid initial schema; start minimal and add fields later via AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD.", "[AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD] May return HTTP 200 while indicating failure (e.g., field already exists); bursts of AIRTABLE_CREATE_TABLE/AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD/AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA can trigger 429—pace calls.", "[AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS] Max 10 records per request; 422 occurs when field names/options don’t match schema or when the required table reference is wrong."], "reference_workbench_snippets": [{"description": "Chunk many field creations to reduce bursty AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD calls", "code": "```python
def chunks(xs,n):
    for i in range(0,len(xs),n):
        yield xs[i:i+n]

for batch in chunks(fields,5):
    for f in batch:
        tool("AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD",{"baseId":base_ref,"tableId":table_ref,**f})
```"}], "difficulty": "easy", "primary_tool_slugs": ["AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE"], "related_tool_slugs": ["AIRTABLE_LIST_BASES", "AIRTABLE_GET_USER_INFO", "AIRTABLE_GET_BASE_SCHEMA", "AIRTABLE_CREATE_TABLE", "AIRTABLE_CREATE_FIELD", "AIRTABLE_CREATE_RECORDS"], "toolkits": ["airtable"], "plan_id": "814288c5d7694e02b19ac8056ebd8e5e"}], "toolkit_connection_statuses": [{"toolkit": "airtable", "has_active_connection": false, "description": "Airtable merges spreadsheet functionality with database power, enabling teams to organize projects, track tasks, and collaborate through customizable views, automation, and integrations for data management", "status_message": "No Active connection for toolkit=airtable. You MUST call COMPOSIO_MANAGE_CONNECTIONS (toolkit="airtable") to create a connection BEFORE executing any airtable tools."}], "tool_schemas": {"AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE": {"toolkit": "AIRTABLE", "tool_slug": "AIRTABLE_CREATE_BASE", "description": "Creates a new Airtable base with specified tables and fields within a workspace.", "input_schema": {"type": "object", "required": ["name", "workspaceId", "tables"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "examples": ["Marketing Campaigns Q3", "Project Phoenix Resources"], "description": "Name for the new Airtable base, visible in the UI."}, "tables": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["name", "fields"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "description": "Name of the table, unique within the base."}, "fields": {"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "required": ["name", "type"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "description": "Name of the field."}, "type": {"enum": ["aiText", "attachment", "multipleAttachments", "autoNumber", "barcode", "button", "checkbox", "singleCollaborator", "count", "createdBy", "createdTime", "currency", "date", "dateTime", "duration", "email", "formula", "lastModifiedBy", "lastModifiedTime", "multipleRecordLinks", "multilineText", "multipleLookupValues", "multiple